# The Daily Page's diary and its scroll stay on this machine. Loudon,
# 2026-10-13: "Lets keep the tuning ledger for this page out of the cloud github."
# and "Keep the scroll local too." On 2026-10-14 he split the ledger: the
# practice's lessons are tracked in the tuning ledger, and what a morning shows
# about him lives in the diary, kept here. Git treats an ignored file as
# expendable, so: never force-add them, and never revert the commit that stopped
# tracking the old ledger (it would write the old copy over the new files).
